[7.69118, "o", "-iwad\r\nIWAD file '%s' not found!\r\n-iwad not specified, trying a few iwad names\r\nunknown.wad\r\nTrying IWAD file:%s\r\nDoom II\r\nplutonia.wad\r\nFinal Doom: Plutonia Experiment\r\ntnt.wad\r\nFinal Doom: TNT: Evilution\r\ndoom.wad\r\nDoom Shareware\r\nchex.wad\r\nhacx.wad\r\nfreedm.wad\r\nfreedoom2.wad\r\nFreedoom: Phase 2\r\nfreedoom1.wad\r\nFreedoom: Phase 1\r\nheretic.wad\r\nheretic1.wad\r\nhexen.wad\r\nstrife1.wad\r\nshow_endoom\r\n WARNING: You are playing using one of the Doom Classic\r\n IWAD files shipped with the Doom 3: BFG Edition. These are\r\n known to be incompatible with the regular IWAD files and\r\nUnknown or invalid IWAD file.\r\nFREEDOOM\r\nThe Ultimate DOOM\r\nDOOM Registered\r\nDOOM Shareware\r\nDOOM 2: Hell on Earth\r\nDOOM 2: Plutonia Experiment\r\nDOOM 2: TNT - Evilution\r\nDoom Generic 0.1\r\ndoomgenericdoom.cfg\r\nGame mode indeterminate.  No IWAD file was found.  Try\r\nspecifying one with the '-iwad' command line parameter.\r\nW_Init: Init WADfiles.\r\n WARNING: The loaded WAD file contains modified sprites or\r\n WARNING: You are playing using one of the F"]
[7.691234, "o", "reedoom IWAD\r\n for more information on how to play using Freedoom:\r\n   http://www.chocolate-doom.org/wiki/index.php/Freedoom\r\nR_Init: Init DOOM refresh daemon - \r\ndoom2\r\nDoom 1.666\r\nDoom 1.7/1.7a\r\nDoom 1.8\r\nDoom 1.9\r\nUltimate Doom\r\nFinal Doom\r\nFinal Doom (alt)\r\nENDOOM\r\nTo continue the DOOM experience, play\r\nDOOM! -- Inferno.\r\nA hidden doorway opens and you enter.\r\nbut now, you see spread before you more\r\nnowadays..\r\nout new hellspawn, but you're ready to\r\nThe vista opening ahead looks real damn\r\nbowels of hell and by golly you're ready\r\nget ready to give the bastard a little Hell\r\nlevel we had ready for ya?  Now you know.\r\nDOOM%02i.%s\r\nFailed to open either '%s' or '%s' to write savegame.\r\nFailed to open savegame file '%s' for writing.\r\nDoom 1.2 does not have a version code!\r\n(read %i, should be %i)\r\n*** You may need to upgrade your version of Doom to v1.9. ***\r\n    See: https://www.doomworld.com/classicdoom/info/patches.php\r\nI'm ready to kick butt!\r\nlevel 6: open season\r\n Doom Generic is free software, cover"]
