[28.318971, "o", "IWAD file '%s' not found!\r\nunknown.wad\r\nTrying IWAD file:%s\r\nplutonia.wad\r\ntnt.wad\r\ndoom.wad\r\nchex.wad\r\nhacx.wad\r\nfreedm.wad\r\nfreedoom2.wad\r\nfreedoom1.wad\r\nheretic.wad\r\nheretic1.wad\r\nhexen.wad\r\nstrife1.wad\r\n IWAD files shipped with the Doom 3: BFG Edition. These are\r\n known to be incompatible with the regular IWAD files and\r\ntitlepic\r\nUnknown or invalid IWAD file.\r\ndoomgenericdoom.cfg\r\nGame mode indeterminate.  No IWAD file was found.  Try\r\n WARNING: You are playing using one of the Freedoom IWAD\r\n/tmp\r\nIWAD\r\nWad file %s doesn't have IWAD or PWAD id\r\nYou are trying to use a %s IWAD file with the %s%s binary.\r\ndoomgeneric\r\nDoomGeneric initialized. Frames will be saved to /tmp/frame.bmp\r\n/tmp/frame.bmp\r\nDoomGeneric title: %s\r\nCannot open file %s\r\n/app/doomgeneric/doomgeneric\r\nAddIWADDir\r\nBuildIWADDirList\r\nIdentifyIWADByName\r\nSearchDirectoryForIWAD\r\nCheckDirectoryHasIWAD\r\nD_FindIWAD\r\nD_FindAllIWADs\r\nD_SaveGameIWADName\r\nD_SuggestIWADName\r\nW_CheckCorrectIWAD\r\ndoomgeneric_Tick\r\nw_title\r\nnull_sector_is_initialized\r\n"]
